## 1. Database Model Extension (`inspections/models.py`)
Add the `QualityIncident` model to `inspections/models.py` (and generate/run migrations `python manage.py makemigrations` and `python manage.py migrate`):
- `incident_id`: CharField (`unique=True`, e.g., `INC-0001`, auto-generated sequentially).
- `inspection`: **`OneToOneField(Inspection, on_delete=models.CASCADE, related_name='quality_incident', unique=True)`** -> Enforces strictly ONE incident per inspection at the database level.
- `product`: `ForeignKey(Product, on_delete=models.PROTECT)`
- `product_id_code`: CharField (e.g., `P-PLATE01`)
- `original_predicted_class`: CharField (snapshot of `inspection.predicted_class`, must be `Defective`)
- `original_confidence`: FloatField (snapshot of `inspection.confidence`)
- `original_defect_probability`: FloatField (snapshot of `inspection.defect_probability`)
- `model_version`: CharField (snapshot of `inspection.model_version`, e.g., `BIT-PLATE-CV-1.0`)
- `summary`: TextField (factual incident summary generated from the saved inspection and product mapping)
- `suggested_actions`: JSONField (default=list) -> List of grounded action objects with citations (`action_title`, `action_detail`, `document_id`, `filename`, `revision`, `page_number`, `passage`, `pdf_url`).
- `citations`: JSONField (default=list) -> Deduped list of all cited SOP page objects.
- `evidence_status`: CharField with choices `Sufficient`, `Insuffcient`
- `evidence_reason`: TextField (blank=True, stores diagnostic reason if SOPs/mappings are missing or retrieval fails).
- `review_status`: CharField with choices `Pending`, `Approved for follow-up`, `Needs more information` (default=`Pending`)
- `review_comment`: TextField (blank=True)
- `reviewed_by`: `ForeignKey(User, null=True, blank=True, on_delete=models.SET_NULL, related_name='reviewed_incidents')`
- `reviewed_at`: DateTimeField (null=True, blank=True)
- `created_by`: `ForeignKey(User, on_delete=models.CASCADE, related_name='created_incidents')`
- `created_at`: DateTimeField (`auto_now_add=True`)
- `updated_at`: DateTimeField (`auto_now=True`)

